Alembic migration environment for Anvex — async (asyncpg), all objects in the `anvex`
schema, including alembic's own `alembic_version` table.

Run everything from `backend/`:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic downgrade -1
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add stocks"
    uv run alembic current

The database URL comes from the repo-root `.env` via `app.settings`, never from
`alembic.ini`. See `env.py`.
